  npcPortrait: {fileID: -3190437382039167500, guid: 5431ebf544be9b14397fcef02b7c0f70, type: 3}
  npcIntroDialogue:
  - "Hey! I heard you\u2019re the one who decorated Uncle Chan\u2019s place."
  - I want to turn this room into a living room for me and my friends.
  - I usually like watching movies, playing games, and hanging out with my friends.
  - I want a really comfortable sofa, and we definitely need a TV.
  - "But I don\u2019t want the room to feel too empty. I\u2019d like some plants,
    pictures, and decorations too."
  - Please trun this room into a place where I'll want to spend the whole day!
  npcCompletionDialogue:
  - Awesome! This is the living room of my dreams! My friends are definitely going
    to want to hang out here!
